      "type": "business",
      "kind": "freight",
      "name": "Pell Freight Desk",
      "summary": "Pell Freight Desk books berths and sealed crates on the Regina highport.",
      "details": "The desk is the counter behind Gallery C. Harun Pell owns it. Sera Quill books the berths. The desk will hire a crew for one sealed crate this week and will not discuss the sender in the hall.",
