      "type": "business",
      "kind": "eatery",
      "name": "The Amber Berth",
      "summary": "The Amber Berth is the eatery on Gallery C.",
      "details": "Laleh Voss owns it. Brokers and off-duty base staff eat here, and Ivo Marsh keeps a table. A berth number is under a plate. Laleh has not decided who should have it.",
